# Bayt Al Hijama — Project Standards

E-commerce for Hijama equipment (Pakistan). Next.js 15 App Router + Supabase + Tailwind.

## Layout
- `src/app/(site)/` — public shop and marketing
- `src/app/(auth)/` — login, signup, password reset
- `src/app/(admin)/admin/` — admin dashboard (products, orders, inventory)
- `src/app/api/` — Route Handlers only (no Server Actions yet)
- `src/lib/` — data access, auth, validation, email
- `src/components/ui/` — reusable form/UI primitives
- `src/sections/` — landing page sections only
- `src/types/db.ts` — database/domain types (mirror `supabase/schema.sql`)
- `supabase/schema.sql` — source of truth for DB shape

## Imports
- Use `@/` path alias (`@/lib/...`, `@/components/...`)
- Barrel import UI from `@/components/ui` when possible

## Scope
- Minimize diff scope; match existing patterns in the file you edit
- PKR currency via `formatPrice()` from `@/utils`
- Site copy/constants in `src/constants/`
